{"version":1,"content":"<p>朝鮮推出首個官方生成式人工智能聊天機械人「智慧之泉」，可回答科學與技術類問題，但被明確限制不得涉及社會政治內容。該系統在平壤舉行的2026年全國信息技術成果展上亮相，被外界視為朝鮮正式進入生成式人工智能領域的重要信號。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587852.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T15:43:57.813310+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":114,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T15:23:47+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T15:37:17.177898+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T15:37:17.177898+00:00","content_hash":"fb2f663a256fb4e59ce915d97a16a0cccdb567179a2c24ac1aad6f84330f2e59","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}